<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/5/measure> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationPositive ;
    cav:judgement """The proposal builds onCOM(2023)207 final (Cybersecurity Skills Academy) “ENISA will develop a pilot project, exploring the set-up of a European attestation scheme for cybersecurity skills”
It makes use of Regulation (EU) 2024/1183 (EUDI wallet) by establishing that- “ENISA and authorised attestation providers shall ensure that the electronic attestations of the European individual cybersecurity skills attestation are issued to the European Digital Identity Wallets”
Cybersecurity
GDPR (retention of records by providers)"""@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeAlignmentMeasure ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/10> ;
    dcterms:description "Assess the alignment with existing digital and sectorial policiesPlease list the applicable digital and sectorial policies identified"@en .

<http://example.org/analysis/assessment/1/6/barrier> a cav:Statement ;
    cav:interpretation iac:InterpretationNegative ;
    cav:judgement "The use and recognition of European individual cybersecurity skills attestation schemes shall remain voluntary for public and private entities."@en ;
    cav:type iac:StatementTypeOrganisationBarrier ;
    m8g:hasRelatedService <http://example.org/analysis/interop/10> ;
    dcterms:description "Assess the organisational measures for a smooth cross-border digital public services deliveryPlease list the governance measures foreseen"@en .

